  "stage": {
    "note": "A plank platform on thin poles over the lagoon under a rusty striped iron roof, no walls but one end of woven sacks: nets folded pale over the back rail and hung from the ridge beam, a bench along the sacks, clothes on a pole, two canoes tied alongside, neighbours' houses across the water and the bridge in the haze behind. The fisherman sits on an upturned crate mending a net; two more sit on the bench out of the sun. The shed is stood lowered by its deck's height, so the deck is where the character walks.",
